  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Key Population Access to HIV and Other Health Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this activity is to strengthen the capacity of the consortium to achieve its mission which is to convene and collectively advocate for the health rights of key populations in Zambia. This advocacy is primarily focused on increasing access for KPs to HIV and other health services.</narrative>
  </description>
